`

In this message, PLMN is set to "INVALID" instead of a valid MCC/MNC. 
SUCI length field set to 8, but with actual content length mismatching this value.

<img width="1122" height="662" alt="Image" src="https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/16121609-996d-4d74-a369-2ce713595fff" />

3. Send the crafted message over an SCTP connection.

## Expected Behavior

The AMF should:
Validate SUCI data before attempting array index access.
Detect malformed PLMN or mismatched length fields and reject the message with an appropriate error response.
Ensure all network connections, UE contexts, and timers are correctly released during error handling, preventing resource leaks.
Avoid panics in NAS message parsing under any malformed or unexpected SUCI values.

